        "original_id": "4b570465-4ad9-5be1-a0c6-000bb66c3460",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards\n- Places: Eko Hotel and Suites, Victoria Island, Lagos, Nigeria, Lagos Lagoon, Atlantic Ocean, Bar Beach\n- Topics: Lagos geography and origins\n\nFacts:\n- The 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards was held on March 7, 2015.\n- The 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards took place at Eko Hotel and Suites in Victoria Island, Lagos, Nigeria.\n- Lagos initially emerged as a port city on a collection of islands in the present-day Local Government Areas of Lagos Island, Eti-Osa, Amuwo-Odofin, and Apapa.\n- The islands of Lagos are separated by creeks at the southwest mouth of Lagos Lagoon.\n- Barrier islands and long sand spits such as Bar Beach protect Lagos from the Atlantic Ocean.\n- Bar Beach stretches up to 100 km east and west of the mouth of Lagos Lagoon.",
